Z||000008||dcaprio||10-09-2001||04:38 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Smoooooth GT:<BR><B>Has anyone modified a set of 84 grill cover's(solid ones) to fit onm a GT??? I think that it would look cool on the Smoooooth GT... If yes, can someone post some pic's??<BR>Thank's ....Steve<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR> If you want a set of 84 covers, I'll give you a set for the price of shipping. About the heat I have a Mustang scoop I'm going to install on my coup. I'm planing to add a small radiator fan under it and wire it to a switch. Just in case. <P>||||reg||1
